# Open 18.4
tags: open, benchmark, 2018
stimulus: "Diane" then a heavier, harder version of it; 165 reps in nine minutes.
note: The handstand walk is 50 ft per round, done in 25 ft sections (15.24 m written here as metres). Capped athletes score total reps.
For time, cap 9:00
21-15-9
  Deadlift 225/155 lb
  Handstand push-up
21-15-9
  Deadlift 315/205 lb
  15.24 m Handstand walk
